{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wUe0v8Q1Gx1794298929.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美軍據報再由英國基地撤走飛機，指受到來自伊朗的威脅。</p><p></p><p>《華爾街日報》引述消息指，多架美軍加油機周一由英格蘭米爾登霍爾空軍基地，轉移至德國等地。另有報道指，該基地亦有多架魚鷹運輸機轉移至其他基地。美國軍方拒絕就調動提供細節，但稱飛機在組裝地與執行任務地點之間的調動，有眾多原因。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.BASE-1630_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lLc2J2r6cd1794299374.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美軍上月初將所有轟炸機撤出英國費爾福德空軍基地，據報同樣是擔心基地可能成為襲擊目標。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.640963+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:58:15.851862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.920963+00:00","content_hash":"961d878bd5bf7a27da9b4ebb801546eeae52d10a4b47711afad152e4d04142e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.640963+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}